====================================================

Implement a genuinely functional AI assistant using Google's Gemini API.

API CONFIGURATION:
- Read the API key from the server-side environment variable GEMINI_API_KEY.
- Use the official supported Gemini SDK/API integration available in the environment.
- Select a model supported by the configured account.
- Never hardcode the API key in source files, frontend code, browser requests, or GitHub.
- Never expose the key in client responses, logs, or source maps.
